<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Cochlearia.</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<p><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#aq">Cochlearia officinalis.</hi></hi> Lo&#x0364;ffelkraut. <hi rendition="#g">Gledit&#x017F;c</hi>h<lb/>
